Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: dln-node
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Description: Lightning node controlled over Nostr
 dln-node is a Lightning node that is reached over Nostr rather than over
 a local socket: Nostr Wallet Connect for the wallet, Nostr Node Control
 for the node itself, with every request authorised by a grant its owner
 published.
 .
 It does not start until it has been configured and given an identity.
 There is no default key and none is generated: a node that comes up as
 somebody else is worse than one that does not come up, because the first
 looks like a network problem for as long as anyone keeps looking.
 .
 This build follows the Bitcoin chain. For the BLAKE2b (XBT) chain, see
 the dln-node-knots package, which installs alongside it.
